                                        "entry_id": "e7bb443e-cd1c-3e72-bc70-e089cab6cf87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An airtight container, made of tin or another metal, used to preserve food, or hold a liquid or some other product."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "British",
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "New-Zealand",
                                            "South-Africa",
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64b4baad-9229-4335-b7e2-0cf5861588d4",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9377d4-9ee5-345d-91ce-1c7fbada5520",
                                                "text": "a tin of baked beans; a tobacco tin; a tin of shoe polish"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ae9722-e13a-4780-b77e-03fb567819c6",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9377d4-9ee5-345d-91ce-1c7fbada5520",
                                                "text": "Several tins of paint were needed to paint the house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a6a4816-d77f-44d4-ad0b-49a69eeb1132",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9377d4-9ee5-345d-91ce-1c7fbada5520",
                                                "text": "empty tins, cans, and plastic containers are recycled in the blue bins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce6d8712-86da-4d41-9187-c7dc663ffedb",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9377d4-9ee5-345d-91ce-1c7fbada5520",
                                                "text": "When it arrived, the train was headed by a \"K\" class 4-6-0 wood-burning locomotive, and a water-tank wagon next to the tender was immediately besieged by women and girls, clad in their picturesque national costume, all with empty kerosene tins for water, a scene which was re-enacted at each stop down the line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                        "entry_id": "e7bb443e-cd1c-3e72-bc70-e089cab6cf87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A metal pan used for baking, roasting, storing food, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a24041bd-deca-4cb0-a08d-55441402d9e9",
                                                "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                                "text": "muffin tin"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3caf890b-b090-436a-8d10-7e466b9764a7",
                                                "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                                "text": "roasting tin"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fb7ba5d-60e2-4e50-810d-7f3db2fcf51d",
                                                "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                                "text": "baking tin"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b7c8f40-ad2f-43bf-a282-92e2893b3824",
                                                "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                                "text": "And, indeed, after a tense round of rolling, shaping and filling delicate pastry dough, Rowan can’t even pull his overstuffed pies out of the tins without them bleeding and oozing fruit filling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fac987b4-e2f9-4b1f-86d4-93531066ece9",
                                                "sense_id": "f27ebeca-d02b-3455-8689-b29e8a457b27",
                                                "text": "Jones was insanely productive last season. He is a clinical route-runner who can line up at any position and catches everything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f8af61f-7cce-3892-9c96-d066b218c641",
                                        "entry_id": "e7bb443e-cd1c-3e72-bc70-e089cab6cf87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bottom part of the front wall, which is \\\"out\\\" if a player strikes it with the ball."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b9da3ab-055e-3136-95da-f5b69c5d00c0",
                                        "entry_id": "e7bb443e-cd1c-3e72-bc70-e089cab6cf87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "money, especially silver money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
